          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūhaya, “Ee Seeba MULUNGU, ka wabalembile lūūlū a banhū benaba nī Yelusalemu ū kūbawīla gīkī, ‘Mukwikala mhola dūhū,’ alīyo tūlīsīnzwa bo līlūshū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo a banhū aba nī Yelusalemu bakūwīlwa, “Nyaga nsebu gwa kūfuma kū matogolo ga magūlya makalamuku gūkūbahuyembela a banhū bane, gwike gūtī gwa kūheheeja shikolo nūūlū kwīnja meela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū nyaga ūyo nalīgūtūma gūlī na nguzu no ū kū yenīyo. Ī haha nalīgūfunya ū nsango gwabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
